<title>BELGIUM: Asturienne H1 1996 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Asturienne H1 1996 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons group net profit		 165    vs    144</p>
<p>    Cons current profit		   314    vs    255</p>
<p>    Turnover				1,830    vs  1,729</p>
<p>NOTE - Compagnie Royale Asturienne des Mines S.A. is a holding company. It said it expected better results in the second half.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
